To: PWG Announcements Reflector <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG will hold its August 2021 Face to Face event next week, August
17-19, 2021. It will be a virtual event, so all sessions will be held via
WebEx. The August 2021 F2F Event Page
<https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/august-2021-virtual.html> provides
the event's daily agenda and teleconference information. Any and all
interested parties are invited to attend.

We hope to see you there!

Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/


